  "name": "WDC Products Hardware Listings Downsampled Source-Schema Variant 4 (abbreviated short-form)",
  "description": "Downsampled subset of the WDC Products benchmark used as benchmark input for the products web-data-integration usecase. Records are hardware product listings (GPUs, SSDs, HDDs and USB sticks) collected from e-commerce sources. Structured attribute values - such as chipset, memory size, storage capacity, read and write speeds, and physical dimensions - were extracted from the raw product titles and descriptions and then normalized. The file keeps a source-shaped schema, and the cluster_id column carries the gold-standard grouping of records that refer to the same real-world product for identity resolution and data fusion.",
